# Job Hunter AI diagrams (Mermaid source)

## 1. Target architecture

```mermaid
flowchart TB
  U[Candidate / User<br/>Profile • Review • Edit • Approve]
  UI[Angular 22 SPA<br/>Dashboard • Search • Application Review Studio]
  API[ASP.NET Core API — .NET 10 LTS<br/>Modular monolith • auth • validation • domain rules]

  subgraph DATA[Persistence and operations]
    DB[(SQL Server / Azure SQL<br/>Profiles • jobs • evidence • versions • approvals • audit)]
    BLOB[(Private object storage<br/>Master CV • DOCX/PDF • snapshots • hashes)]
    Q[[Durable queue + DLQ<br/>Retries • backoff • idempotency]]
    OBS[Key Vault + App Insights<br/>Secrets • metrics • traces • alerts]
  end

  subgraph WORKERS[Background workers]
    ING[Job ingestion<br/>Normalize • deduplicate • expire]
    VISA[Sponsorship rules<br/>Country-specific official evidence]
    AI[AI and documents<br/>Parse • match • tailor • verify]
    PW[Playwright worker<br/>Prefill • compare live form • safe submit]
    CONTACT[Recruiter contact finder<br/>Source-backed email or NotFound]
    MAIL[Mail adapter<br/>Gmail / Microsoft Graph after confirmation]
  end

  subgraph EXT[External integrations - only permitted access paths]
    JOBS[Greenhouse • Lever • Ashby<br/>Permitted company career pages]
    GOV[UK sponsor register<br/>Country-specific official sources]
    LLM[Configured LLM providers<br/>Minimum necessary data]
    EMP[Employer application page<br/>Supported ATS path or human handoff]
    PUB[Official company contact pages<br/>Trusted public contact sources]
    EMAIL[Candidate mailbox<br/>Gmail / Microsoft 365 OAuth]
  end

  U --> UI --> API
  API <--> DB
  API <--> BLOB
  API --> Q
  API -. telemetry / secret refs .-> OBS
  Q --> ING
  Q --> VISA
  Q --> AI
  Q --> PW
  Q --> CONTACT
  Q --> MAIL
  ING --> JOBS
  VISA --> GOV
  AI <--> LLM
  AI --> BLOB
  PW <--> EMP
  CONTACT --> PUB
  MAIL <--> EMAIL
  PW --> DB
  CONTACT --> DB
  MAIL --> DB

  RULES[Cross-cutting controls<br/>Version-bound human approval • evidence provenance • least privilege<br/>rate limits • content hashes • audit • privacy minimisation]
  RULES -. governs .-> API
  RULES -. governs .-> WORKERS
```

## 2. Discovery and preparation workflow

```mermaid
flowchart TD
  A[Candidate profile + immutable master CV] --> B[Discover jobs via permitted source adapters]
  B --> C[Normalize • deduplicate • retain original URL and snapshot]
  C --> D[Evaluate sponsorship using vacancy text + official country source]
  D --> E[Extract requirements and map to verified profile evidence]
  E --> F{Passes candidate filters?}
  F -- No --> G[Store excluded reason; keep job link]
  F -- Yes --> H[Generate tailored CV + cover letter + suggested form answers]
  H --> I[Recruiter contact discovery from trusted public sources]
  I --> J{Relevant public email found?}
  J -- Yes --> K[Prepare editable outreach draft with versioned attachments]
  J -- No --> L[Show: Not able to find a verified recruiter email for this job profile]
  K --> M[Review Studio]
  L --> M
  M[Review CV • letter • every form field • source evidence • ATS checks]
```

## 3. Application approval and outreach workflow

```mermaid
flowchart TD
  A[Review complete application pack] --> B{Blocking fields or conflicts?}
  B -- Yes --> C[Edit / confirm / resolve issues]
  C --> A
  B -- No --> D[User approves exact immutable version]
  D --> E[Persist application version ID + document hashes + form hash + timestamp]
  E --> F[Server revalidates approval, destination, required fields and duplicate guard]
  F --> G[Prefill permitted employer form]
  G --> H{Live form exactly matches approved payload?}
  H -- No --> I[Stop and return to review; approval invalidated]
  I --> A
  H -- Yes --> J{Supported and permitted submission path?}
  J -- No --> K[Human handoff to original job URL]
  J -- Yes --> L[Submit and store confirmation evidence]
  L --> N{Outcome confirmed?}
  N -- Yes --> O[Submitted]
  N -- No / timeout --> P[SubmissionUnknown; investigate before retry]
  K --> Q[Track application outcome]
  O --> Q
  P --> Q
  A --> R[Separate outreach review]
  R --> S[User explicitly confirms current recipient, body and attachments]
  S --> T[Send through user-authorized Gmail API / Microsoft Graph]
  T --> U[Track email outcome separately]
```
